      "id": "legacy-hook",
      "level": "warn",
      "places": [
        "lib/Hooks.php:21 OCP\\Config::js: the manual names no replacement event",
        "lib/Hooks.php:23 OC\\Files::preDelete: removed after the range, in Nextcloud 36, replaced by OCP\\Files\\Events\\Node\\BeforeNodeDeletedEvent"
      ],
      "lines": [
        "2 connections to a legacy hook of the server. A hook the server removed is never emitted, and the listener never runs; the typed events of OCP\\EventDispatcher replace the hooks.",
